5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry that desks decide who we talk to. Let us look at how we sit now.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The current layout hides who gets the worst spots. We need to name that imbalance.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I am quiet, but I worry about the money. Can we check the floor billing basis?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"My mornings are tight. I need to know what the change costs in time, not just yen.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I sit still for eight hours. If the chair and desk do not fit, I am done.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, yes. If we do not choose, the furniture chooses for us.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Exactly. I want a rule that rotates the burden, not a permanent hierarchy of comfort.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree with Shizue. But if we move desks, do we pay for new power lines?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, that is my fear. If we need electricians, my first coffee is gone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I do not care about coffee. I care about my lower back. Let us check the physio note.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, your back matters. But if we sit in a row, we never speak.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"A row is efficient, but it is unfair. The end of the row always suffers.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should look at the facilities quote. I want to know the real cost.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will look at the badge records. I need to see when we actually arrive.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I will check the sound meter readings. Silence is a feature, not a bug.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the staff survey. I want to know what people actually want.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will look at the unplanned seat shuffles. I want to see how often we break the rules.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the facilities quote and the floor billing. I need the numbers.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will look at the badge records and the morning routine upstairs. I need the time data.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the sound meter readings and the physio note. I need the comfort data.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
