35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The survey says the wall desks are the problem. The new joiners say the noise is the gift.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The shuffles prove we cannot trust the layout to stay fair. It breaks every time life changes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the quote. Moving a desk costs 6,200 yen. And we pay for empty space.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"I found the badge times. We arrive at different times. If we pick desks first, the latecomers lose.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,I found the sound data. The printer row is nine decibels louder. And the physio says my chair needs days to settle.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, that is why I want a rule. If we pick by arrival, the early birds always get the window.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, yes. And the shuffles show that even a good rule gets broken by accident.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, the quote is the same for every move. So if we change the plan, we pay again.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, that is the trap. If we change the plan, we pay, and we lose the morning.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, I do not care about the morning. I care about the chair. If I move, I lose the setting.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, I hear you. But if we sit in a row, we never talk. And the new joiners need to talk.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, a row is a hierarchy. The end of the row is the punishment. I want to avoid that.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should keep the desks where they are. The quote says moving is expensive.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,I think we should keep the desks where they are. The badge times say we arrive at different times.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,I think we should keep the desks where they are. The sound data says the window side is quiet.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am not sure. The survey says the wall desks are the problem. But the new joiners say the noise is the gift.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I am not sure. The shuffles show we cannot trust the layout. But the quote says moving is expensive.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am leaning toward keeping the desks. The numbers say moving is expensive.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am leaning toward keeping the desks. The time data says moving is expensive.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am leaning toward keeping the desks. The comfort data says moving is expensive.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
